  {page==="Nutrition"&&<section className="content"><div className="pageintro"><span className="eyebrow green">THE BIG PICTURE</span><h1>Know what's <em>on your plate.</em></h1><p>Explore the estimated nutrition in your saved recipes, per serving.</p></div><div className="nutritioncards">{visibleRecipes.map(r=>{let n=nutrition(r);return <div className="nutritioncard" key={r.id} onClick={()=>{setSelected(r.id);setPage("Recipes")}}><div><b>{r.name}</b><small>{r.servings} {r.servings===1?"serving":"servings"} per batch</small></div><strong>{Math.round(n.kcal/r.servings)} <small>kcal</small></strong><div className="nutribottom"><span>{(n.protein/r.servings).toFixed(1)}g protein</span><span>{(netCarbs(r)/r.servings).toFixed(1)}g net carbs</span></div></div>})}</div><p className="fineprint">Nutrition is estimated from typical ingredient values and saved quantities. For best accuracy, replace estimates with the nutrition label on your exact products. Net carbs are calculated as total carbohydrates minus dietary fibre. Fibre values need to be entered for accurate results.</p></section>}
